# Local-only operator files. No Dockerfile COPYs any of them and none may enter a build context.
# This is the ONLY ignore file that applies to every image built here, because Docker and Podman
# read `.dockerignore` from the CONTEXT ROOT and every image in this repository is built with the
# repository root as its context - a per-directory one beside a Dockerfile is simply not consulted.
# A test builds the real context and asserts these paths did not arrive in it.
#
# Do NOT add `**/build` here: `infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile.service` copies
# `services/karyo-app/build/quarkus-app/` out of this same context.
scripts/.env.prod*
scripts/.license-signing-key
distribution/.env
distribution/config
distribution/catalog.json
